</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column gdlr-core-column-15"  id="gdlr-core-column-26101" ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column-content-margin gdlr-core-js " style="padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"   ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-background-wrap" style="background-color: #004f86 ;"  ></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column-content clearfix gdlr-core-js "   ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-element" ><div class="gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align" style="padding-bottom: 15px ;"  ><div class="gdlr-core-text-box-item-content" style="font-size: 20px ;font-weight: 600 ;text-transform: none ;color: #ffffff ;"  ><p style="color: #ffffff; text-align: center; margin: 0;" aria-label="The number of programs is more than 80"><span style="font-size: 50pt; font-weight: bold; display: block; line-height: 1;">80+</span><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: 500; display: block; margin-top: 4px;">degrees, certificates, and workplace credentials offered</span></p>
</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column gdlr-core-column-15"  id="gdlr-core-column-86834" ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column-content-margin gdlr-core-js "   ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-background-wrap" style="background-color: #004f86 ;"  ></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column-content clearfix gdlr-core-js "   ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-element" ><div class="gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align" style="padding-bottom: 15px ;"  ><div class="gdlr-core-text-box-item-content" style="font-size: 20px ;font-weight: 600 ;text-transform: none ;color: #ffffff ;"  ><p style="color: #ffffff; text-align: center; margin: 0;" aria-label="The number of scholarships available is more than 200"><span style="font-size: 50pt; font-weight: bold; display: block; line-height: 1;">200+</span><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: 500; display: block; margin-top: 4px;">scholarship opportunities available</span></p>
</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column gdlr-core-column-15"  id="gdlr-core-column-97573" ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column-content-margin gdlr-core-js "   ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-background-wrap" style="background-color: #004f86 ;"  ></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column-content clearfix gdlr-core-js "   ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-element" ><div class="gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align" style="padding-bottom: 15px ;"  ><div class="gdlr-core-text-box-item-content" style="font-size: 20px ;font-weight: 600 ;text-transform: none ;color: #ffffff ;"  ><p style="color: #ffffff; text-align: center; margin: 0;" aria-label="The cost is half"><span style="font-size: 50pt; font-weight: bold; display: block; line-height: 1;">1/2</span><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: 500; display: block; margin-top: 4px;">the cost of a public four-year institution</span></p>
