<p><a style="text-decoration: underline;" href="https://angelinaathletics.com/landing/index">Explore</a><a style="text-decoration: underline;" href="https://angelinaathletics.com/landing/index"> Athletics</a></p>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column gdlr-core-column-15"  id="gdlr-core-column-19649" ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column-content-margin gdlr-core-js "   ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-background-wrap"  ></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column-content clearfix gdlr-core-js "   ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-element" ><div class="gdlr-core-column-service-item gdlr-core-item-pdb  gdlr-core-left-align gdlr-core-column-service-icon-left gdlr-core-no-caption gdlr-core-item-pdlr" style="padding-bottom: 30px;"  ><div class="gdlr-core-column-service-media gdlr-core-media-icon " style="margin-top: 10px;"  ><i class="fa fa-arrow-circle-right" style="font-size: 25px ;line-height: 25px ;width: 25px ;color: #ff671f ;"  ></i></div><div class="gdlr-core-column-service-content-wrapper" ><div class="gdlr-core-column-service-title-wrap"  ><h3 class="gdlr-core-column-service-title gdlr-core-skin-title" style="font-size: 28px ;font-weight: 700 ;text-transform: none ;"  >Stay Connected</h3></div><div class="gdlr-core-column-service-content" style="font-size: 18px ;font-weight: 600 ;text-transform: none ;"  ><p>Follow Us For Updates</p>
<p><a style="text-decoration: underline;" href="https://www.facebook.com/AngelinaCollege">Follow Us</a></p>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-element" ><div class="gdlr-core-space-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr " style="padding-top: 30px ;"  ></div></div></div></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-wrapper " style="padding: 90px 0px 60px 0px;" ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-background-wrap" style="background-color: #f6f8fb ;"  ></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-wrapper-content gdlr-core-js "   ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-wrapper-container clearfix gdlr-core-container" ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-element" ><div class="gdlr-core-tab-item gdlr-core-js gdlr-core-item-pdb  gdlr-core-left-align gdlr-core-tab-style1-horizontal gdlr-core-item-pdlr"  ><div class="gdlr-core-tab-item-content-image-wrap clearfix" ><div class="gdlr-core-tab-item-image  gdlr-core-active" data-tab-id="1" ><span class="gdlr-core-tab-item-image-background" style="background-image: url(https://www.angelina.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Photo-31_VN-Pinning_12_4_2023-copy-jpeg.webp) ;"  ></span></div><div class="gdlr-core-tab-item-image " data-tab-id="2" ><span class="gdlr-core-tab-item-image-background" style="background-image: url(https://www.angelina.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Valedictorian-Juan-Mercado-1_AC-Law-Enforcement-Academy-Class-116-Graduation_June-2024-copy.jpg) ;"  ></span></div><div class="gdlr-core-tab-item-image " data-tab-id="3" ><span class="gdlr-core-tab-item-image-background" style="background-image: url(https://www.angelina.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Dr-Simon-and-Grad-1_AC-Commencement_5_10_2024_Jessica-Deel-Photo-copy.jpg) ;"  ></span></div><div class="gdlr-core-tab-item-image " data-tab-id="4" ><span class="gdlr-core-tab-item-image-background" style="background-image: url(https://www.angelina.edu/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Apply-Now.jpeg) ;"  ></span></div></div><div class="gdlr-core-tab-item-wrap" ><div class="gdlr-core-tab-item-title-wrap clearfix gdlr-core-title-font" ><div class="gdlr-core-tab-item-title  gdlr-core-active" data-tab-id="1" ><h2 style="font-size:20px;">Why Angelina College?</h2></div><div class="gdlr-core-tab-item-title " data-tab-id="2" ><h3 style="font-size:20px;">Our Mission</h3></div><div class="gdlr-core-tab-item-title " data-tab-id="3" ><h3 style="font-size:20px;">Our Vision</h3></div><div class="gdlr-core-tab-item-title " data-tab-id="4" ><h3 style="font-size:20px;">Get Involved</h3></div></div><div class="gdlr-core-tab-item-content-wrap clearfix" ><div class="gdlr-core-tab-item-content  gdlr-core-active" data-tab-id="1" style="color: #424242 ;background-color: #ffffff ;background-image: url(https://www.angelina.edu/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Angelina_Tab_module_logo.png) ;background-position: top right ;"  ><p>Located in Lufkin, Texas, a city of 36,000, AC offers the best features of rural and suburban living in the safe and attractive “pineywoods” region of Texas. Lufkin is known for its rich community and cultural events; excellent healthcare services; vibrant local businesses; and proximity to beautiful lakes, forests, and rivers. The city’s catchphrase really says it all, “You’ll Love Lufkin!”</p>
<p>Not local to Lufkin? We offer several online, virtual, and hybrid classes to our students. Another reason to love AC!</p>
</div><div class="gdlr-core-tab-item-content " data-tab-id="2" style="color: #424242 ;background-color: #ffffff ;background-image: url(https://www.angelina.edu/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Angelina_Tab_module_logo.png) ;background-position: top right ;"  ><div class="page" title="Page 6">
<div class="layoutArea">
<div class="column">
<p>The MISSION of Angelina College is to provide quality educational opportunities and services to aid students and the community in reaching their full potential.</p>
</div>
<p> </p>
</div>
</div>
</div><div class="gdlr-core-tab-item-content " data-tab-id="3" style="color: #424242 ;background-color: #ffffff ;background-image: url(https://www.angelina.edu/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Angelina_Tab_module_logo.png) ;background-position: top right ;"  ><p>The VISION of Angelina College is to be the first choice in value and quality education leading to diverse career pathways throughout its service area.</p>
<p> </p>
<p> </p>
</div><div class="gdlr-core-tab-item-content " data-tab-id="4" style="color: #424242 ;background-color: #ffffff ;background-image: url(https://www.angelina.edu/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Angelina_Tab_module_logo.png) ;background-position: top right ;"  ><p>Our Student Life includes student clubs and organizations, Phi Theta Kappa (National Honor Society &amp; 4 Star Chapter), incredible athletic programs, and several fine arts programs including Theater, Chorale, Jazz Band, and Concert Band. There is something for everyone at Angelina College! Here you have the opportunity to experience personal growth and discovery, academic and professional development, and the kind of experiences that make for lifelong memories.</p>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-wrapper " style="padding: 125px 0px 90px 0px;" data-skin="White Text" ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-background-wrap" style="background-color: #004f86 ;"  ></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-wrapper-content gdlr-core-js "   ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-wrapper-container clearfix gdlr-core-container" ><div class=" gdlr-core-pbf-wrapper-container-inner gdlr-core-item-mglr clearfix" style="background-color: #004f86 ;"  ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column gdlr-core-column-20 gdlr-core-column-first"  id="gdlr-core-column-22515" ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column-content-margin gdlr-core-js "   ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-background-wrap" style="background-color: #004f86 ;"  ></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column-content clearfix gdlr-core-js "   ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-element" ><div class="gdlr-core-title-item gdlr-core-item-pdb clearfix  gdlr-core-left-align gdlr-core-title-item-caption-bottom gdlr-core-item-pdlr" style="padding-bottom: 20px ;"  ><div class="gdlr-core-title-item-title-wrap clearfix" ><h2 class="gdlr-core-title-item-title gdlr-core-skin-title " style="font-size: 60px ;font-weight: 700 ;letter-spacing: 0px ;text-transform: none ;color: #ffffff ;"  >Explore Majors & Careers</h2></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column gdlr-core-column-40"  id="gdlr-core-column-98912" ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column-content-margin gdlr-core-js "   ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-background-wrap" style="background-color: #004f86 ;"  ></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column-content clearfix gdlr-core-js "   ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-element" ><div class="gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align" style="padding-bottom: 15px ;"  ><div class="gdlr-core-text-box-item-content" style="font-size: 19px ;font-weight: 600 ;text-transform: none ;color: #ffffff ;"  ><p>Learn more about our academic programs, categorized into four distinct schools of instruction  including:</p>
<ul>
<li>School of Arts and Education</li>
<li>School of Business and Technology</li>
<li>School of Science and Mathematics</li>
<li>School of Health Careers</li>
</ul>
