</div></div></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-element" ><div class="gdlr-core-title-item gdlr-core-item-pdb clearfix  gdlr-core-center-align gdlr-core-title-item-caption-bottom gdlr-core-item-pdlr" style="padding-bottom: 10px ;"  ><div class="gdlr-core-title-item-title-wrap clearfix" ><h3 class="gdlr-core-title-item-title gdlr-core-skin-title " style="font-size: 35px ;font-weight: 700 ;letter-spacing: 0px ;text-transform: none ;"  >Be A Roadrunner.</h3></div></div></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-element" ><div class="gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-center-align" style="padding-bottom: 20px ;"  ><div class="gdlr-core-text-box-item-content" style="font-size: 20px ;text-transform: none ;"  ><p>Apply today. Let our committed staff assist you in the application process.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-element" ><div class="gdlr-core-button-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-center-align" style="padding-bottom: 55px ;"  ><a class="gdlr-core-button  gdlr-core-button-solid gdlr-core-button-no-border" href="https://myac.angelina.edu/ICS/Admissions/" target="_blank"  style="font-size: 18px ;font-weight: 700 ;color: #ffffff ;padding: 15px 30px 15px 30px;text-transform: none ;border-radius: 5px;-moz-border-radius: 5px;-webkit-border-radius: 5px;"  ><span class="gdlr-core-content" >Apply Now</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-wrapper " style="padding: 125px 0px 90px 0px;" data-skin="White Text" ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-background-wrap" style="background-color: #004f86 ;"  ></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-wrapper-content gdlr-core-js "   ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-wrapper-container clearfix gdlr-core-container" ><div class=" gdlr-core-pbf-wrapper-container-inner gdlr-core-item-mglr clearfix" style="background-color: #004f86 ;"  ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column gdlr-core-column-20 gdlr-core-column-first"  id="gdlr-core-column-89025" ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column-content-margin gdlr-core-js "   ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-background-wrap" style="background-color: #004f86 ;"  ></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column-content clearfix gdlr-core-js "   ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-element" ><div class="gdlr-core-title-item gdlr-core-item-pdb clearfix  gdlr-core-left-align gdlr-core-title-item-caption-bottom gdlr-core-item-pdlr" style="padding-bottom: 20px ;"  ><div class="gdlr-core-title-item-title-wrap clearfix" ><h2 class="gdlr-core-title-item-title gdlr-core-skin-title " style="font-size: 60px ;font-weight: 700 ;letter-spacing: 0px ;text-transform: none ;color: #ffffff ;"  >Angelina College Foundation</h2></div><span class="gdlr-core-title-item-caption gdlr-core-info-font gdlr-core-skin-caption" style="font-size: 14px ;font-weight: 600 ;font-style: normal ;"  >To support the development of quality educational services for students, the Angelina College Foundation was established in May 2019.</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column gdlr-core-column-40"  id="gdlr-core-column-21008" ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column-content-margin gdlr-core-js "   ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-background-wrap" style="background-color: #004f86 ;"  ></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column-content clearfix gdlr-core-js "   ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-element" ><div class="gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align" style="padding-bottom: 15px ;"  ><div class="gdlr-core-text-box-item-content" style="font-size: 19px ;font-weight: 600 ;text-transform: none ;color: #ffffff ;"  ><p>As a 501(c)(3) nonprofit, tax-exempt organization, the Foundation raises funds for Angelina College through a variety of creative events and partnerships with alumni, friends, donors, businesses, and foundations.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-element" ><div class="gdlr-core-text-box-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align" style="padding-bottom: 15px ;"  ><div class="gdlr-core-text-box-item-content" style="font-size: 19px ;font-weight: 600 ;text-transform: none ;"  ><p>The vision of the Angelina College Foundation is to develop financial resources and to grow public support that strengthens the college’s ability to provide quality educational opportunities and services to aid students in the service area in reaching their full potential.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-element" ><div class="gdlr-core-button-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align"  ><a class="gdlr-core-button  gdlr-core-button-transparent gdlr-core-button-with-border" href="https://www.angelina.edu/angelina-college-foundation/"  id="gdlr-core-button-id-90655"  ><span class="gdlr-core-content" >AC Foundation Webpage</span><i class="gdlr-core-pos-right fa fa-long-arrow-right" style="font-size: 24px ;color: #ffffff ;"  ></i></a></div></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-element" ><div class="gdlr-core-button-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb gdlr-core-left-align"  ><a class="gdlr-core-button  gdlr-core-button-transparent gdlr-core-button-with-border" href="https://www.paypal.com/donate/?cmd=_s-xclick&#038;hosted_button_id=UHGAA5QWEDRMA&#038;source=url"  id="gdlr-core-button-id-19300"  ><span class="gdlr-core-content" >Donate Now</span><i class="gdlr-core-pos-right fa fa-long-arrow-right" style="font-size: 24px ;color: #ffffff ;"  ></i></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-wrapper " ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-wrapper-content gdlr-core-js "   ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-wrapper-container clearfix gdlr-core-container" ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column gdlr-core-column-36 gdlr-core-column-first"  id="gdlr-core-column-76976" ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column-content-margin gdlr-core-js " style="padding: 0px 25px 0px 0px;"   ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-background-wrap" style="border-width: 0px 1px 0px 0px;border-color: #ffffff ;border-style: solid ;"  ></div><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-column-content clearfix gdlr-core-js "   ><div class="gdlr-core-pbf-element" ><div class="gdlr-core-title-item gdlr-core-item-pdb clearfix  gdlr-core-left-align gdlr-core-title-item-caption-bottom gdlr-core-item-pdlr"  ><div class="gdlr-core-title-item-title-wrap clearfix" ><h2 class="gdlr-core-title-item-title gdlr-core-skin-title " style="font-size: 35px ;font-weight: 700 ;te